  "gui.moreGames.html": "更多 R74n 游戏：<a href=\"https://R74n.com/gentown/\" target=\"_blank\">GenTown <span style=\"color:red\">（新）</span></a>、<a href=\"https://R74n.com/cook/\" target=\"_blank\">Infinite Chef</a>",
